OL,3,AHundreds of criminals start leaving
OL,4,Aprison under new early release scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of criminals are being
OL,7,Freleased early from prisons in England
OL,8,Fand Wales under new rules introduced to
OL,9,Fprevent facilities reaching capacity.
OL,11,FThe first 700 of an expected 4,500
OL,12,Finmates eligible under the scheme were
OL,13,Fdue to be let out on Thursday.
OL,15,FThe government has stressed they will
OL,16,Fremain subject to strict monitoring
OL,17,Farrangements, including the expanded
OL,18,Fuse of electronic tagging, and has said
OL,19,Faction was needed to prevent prisons
OL,20,Ffrom becoming full.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
