OL,3,AWhat happened in the failed execution
OL,4,Aof Christa Pike - and what next?
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS convicted murderer Christa Pike is
OL,7,Fin a critical condition in hospital
OL,8,Fafter Tennessee authorities failed to
OL,9,Fexecute her by lethal injection, her
OL,10,Flawyer says.
OL,12,FThe case of Pike, whose attempted
OL,13,Fexecution on Wednesday had already been
OL,14,Fthe subject of a high-profile legal
OL,15,Fbattle, has raised a number of
OL,16,Fquestions.
OL,18,FThese include what went wrong, what
OL,19,Fhappens next, and - for opponents of
OL,20,Fthe death penalty - fresh concerns
OL,21,Faround the suffering of an inmate when
OL,22,Fan execution does not go to plan.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
