OL,3,ANetanyahu says Flydubai attacker had
OL,4,A'Islamist radical indoctrination'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNetanyahu told Fox News that it was
OL,7,Flooking "very likely" that the
OL,8,Fattacker, who he said was an Omani
OL,9,Fnational, "was going to down the
OL,10,Fplane".
OL,12,FMeanwhile, the United Arab Emirates
OL,13,F(UAE) state news agency reports
OL,14,Finvestigations have begun there to
OL,15,Fdetermine "whether the incident was
OL,16,Flinked to any terrorist activity or
OL,17,Fpurpose".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
